  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Unbroken Bonds prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 20–21 and 27–28 April 2019, and later sold in shops. Each box held four Unbroken Bonds booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Unbroken Bonds logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Lucario and Red's Challenge, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
